        <ul>
          <li><a href="/research/northern-ireland/">Northern Ireland</a>: reconciliation, constructive dialogue and leadership in divided societies.</li>
          <li><a href="/research/chile/">Chile</a>: the Clinical Master's Program Collaboration with Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile and a parenting intervention with Fundación San Carlos de Maipo.</li>
          <li><a href="/research/ties/">TIES</a>: Texas Initiative Enhancing Rural-Border Solutions.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>

{# ---------- Faculty research preview ---------- #}
<section class="section" aria-labelledby="faculty-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section__head">
