{# ---------- Partners + coming soon ---------- #}
<section class="section section--sand" aria-labelledby="partners-title">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split">
      <div class="flow">
        <p class="eyebrow">Research partners</p>
        <h2 class="section__title" id="partners-title">Institutions we work with</h2>
        <ul class="feature-list">
          <li><strong>Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile</strong>, Santiago: an alliance of about 11 years, including Chile's first clinical master's in social work.</li>
          <li><strong>Fundación San Carlos de Maipo</strong>, Chile: parenting intervention adaptation and dissemination.</li>
          <li><strong>Corrymeela</strong>, Ballycastle, Northern Ireland: partner in "Leading with Peace: Lessons from Northern Ireland."</li>
          <li><strong>Tallinn University</strong>, Estonia: doctoral education and Erasmus+ faculty exchange.</li>
          <li><strong>UT Latino Research Institute</strong> and <strong>George Washington University's Gill-Lebovic Center for Community Health in the Caribbean and Latin America</strong>: partners in Cortando la Brecha, with a research collaboration at Ponce Medical School.</li>
          <li><strong>Universidad Autónoma de Baja California</strong> and <strong>UNAM</strong>, Mexico: faculty-led initiatives and visiting scholars.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="btn btn--outline" href="/about/partners/">See all partners</a>
      </div>
      <div class="split__media">
        <div class="notice notice--launch flow">
          <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
          <h3>Global research, pulled automatically</h3>
          <p>In the medium term, this page will draw directly from the School's research database. Faculty will tag entries "global," and tagged projects, publications and grants will appear here automatically, keeping the picture of the School's international scholarship current without a separate submission.</p>
          <p class="small muted">Until then, faculty can <a href="/connect/">contact OGE</a> to have their global work added to the <a href="/research/faculty/">Faculty Research</a> page.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

